*                   Ragexe with the RO Global Zero 238x59 HP/SP HUD. It    *
*                   draws the live Base Level, character name, HP/SP       *
*                   values, and percentages, creates a native 52x52 Job    *
*                   icon child, adds the native Job-name hover tooltip,    *
*                   suppresses the legacy lower menu window, and forces    *
*                   Alt+V to retain the compact layout. This is QJS-only.  *
*                                                                          *
